WEBVTT

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.660
Why do you raise your weapons against me, Yukine?

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.540
Must I take that silence as your answer?

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.300
What do you extend your hand for?

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.730
I can't let anyone else bear my cross!

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:43.930
What?

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:53.860
What do you mean by while you're still you?

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.410
Finé's soul is inside me,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.800
and it's about to awaken.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.750
I'm one of the Receptor Children, 
who was brought to that orphanage.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.370
There was a possibility this would happen.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.040
Then it's even more important I stop you.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.510
So you don't lose any more of yourself.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.760
To protect the Kiri-chan I love.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.300
Don't say you love me!

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.800
I love you far more!

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:21.930
That's why...

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.060
I'm going to protect the world in 
which the people I love live!

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:26.560
Kiri-chan...

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.820
<b>Emergency Type Phi Twin Moon Karma</b>

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:33.990
Shirabe...

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.570
<b>Sealed Slash: Pinocchio</b>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.410
I'm telling you

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:43.210
I love you!

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.540
<b>Episode 12 
Striking Spear</b>

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.900
This is the result of my troublesome little student.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.360
Shouldn't we just be happy 
she gave you the chance?

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.510
Commander!

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:02.180
What?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.550
Before you go, look at this.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.940
<i>I am Maria Cadenzavna Eve.</i>

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:12.820
<i>In order to minimize the damage 
caused by the falling Moon,</i>

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.190
<i>I falsely claimed the name "Finé."</i>

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.700
<i>The irregularities in the Moon's orbit</i>

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:19.000
<i>This is video data being sent from Frontier.</i>

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:24.950
<i>that the Lunar Attack began, six months ago were,</i>

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.280
<i>It's being broadcast all over the world.</i>

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.950
At this point, what is FIS after?

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.450
<i>at the order of Director Adam Weishaupt,</i>

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.960
<i>carefully concealed by the US, the Security 
Council, and the Bavarian Illuminati.</i>

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:35.880
<i>The truth was very inconvenient to an elite class</i>

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.880
<i>that exclusively controls a portion of</i>

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.380
<i>the political and economic spheres.</i>

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:46.270
The Moon... With my songs?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.290
The Moon is an observation device

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:54.690
set up by the Custodians, to strip humanity 
of its mutual understanding.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:59.190
The Lunar Attack shut down 
some of its functionality.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.410
But if the Moon can be restarted, it can 
be returned to its original orbit.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.160
Mom! Mom!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:12.230
Save the world with your songs...

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.830
I've lied about everything thus far,

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.210
so I'm not confident that my words will reach you.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.780
But the one thing I want you to believe

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:23.460
is the fact that songs can become power!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:33.520
<i>Granzizel bilfen Gungnir zizzl.</i>

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:41.530
<i>Kort el fes Gungnir! Kort el fes Gungnir!</i>

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.720
By itself, my power isn't enough

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:02.010
to handle the falling Moon!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.880
So help me.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.490
I want you to give me your songs!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:12.520
<i>For whose sake does my voice resound?</i>

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:19.550
<i>And for whom should this song be?</i>

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.900
<i>I'll use this life that Serena saved</i>

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:25.540
<i>I decided I'd never lose anything again...</i>

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.530
<i>to save someone else's.</i>

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.620
<i>That is the one thing I can do to repay her!</i>

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:33.080
<i>The miracle of my feelings will shatter my destiny.</i>

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:30.160
Ogawa!

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.080
I know. I'll follow the source of this video.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:38.430
<i>Lives whose hearts beat in battle,</i>

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.380
<i>bring your love together, as the cadenza plays.</i>

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.380
<i>Someone's doing their best...</i>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.460
<i>I need to do the same!</i>

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:51.270
<i>There's no answer, except to go forward!</i>

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.730
If you don't hurry, you won't get the toy you want.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.880
<i>The Staff of Solomon...</i>

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.910
<i>Humanity shouldn't have a power</i>

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.090
<i>that only kills humans.</i>

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.340
<i>Is he using that to make Yukine obey him?</i>

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.880
What do you want so much that 
you're willing to wear a dog collar?

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:28.080
Those without homes always do the dirty work.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:28.890
Am I wrong?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.230
I'm taking you home, if I have 
to drag you by the neck.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:36.890
To your home, the place you'll return to.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.790
No matter how strongly you refuse me,

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.650
I'll help you.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:48.160
And since I know that, 
with one wing, I cannot fly...

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.030
Making the wind blow is my duty!

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.590
<i>That's right. Isn't it, Kanade?</i>

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.590
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.580
<i>Then I'll help you with what you want,</i>

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.770
<i>and so will those around you.</i>

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.470
Don't talk like you understand!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.980
What are you doing?

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:13.690
There's very little time until the 
geas on your neck explodes.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.730
Kazanari-senpai...

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.660
I'll end this with the next attack.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:27.240
All this time, I've worked on 
this combination attack.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.240
Then I'll show you the killing side of my blade.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.220
<b>Thousand Falling Tears</b>

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.280
Exactly what I hoped would happen.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.740
Gotcha!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.240
I've lost both the Ame no Habakiri 
and the Ichaival's signals.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.320
Tsubasa... Chris-kun...

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:22.210
<i>I've got good medicine and an 
operation for stubborn girls.</i>

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.340
<i>No mercy for my targets.</i>

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.300
<i>Uninstalling my emotions.</i>

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.470
<i>For some reason, the sound of clashing blades</i>

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.720
<b>Emergency Type Sigma Forbidden Moon Wheel</b>

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.460
<i>sounds like a lonely rhapsody.</i>

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.970
<b>Dual-Slash Cinderella</b>

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:40.460
<i>With a double-bladed kiss, 
I'll save you from the cage.</i>

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:46.570
<i>I can't wait to slice apart these tears!</i>

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:46.570
<i>Cry out and slice apart these tears and everything!</i>

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:51.950
<i>Feelings that have gone critical...</i>

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:51.950
<i>A heart I can't fully share...</i>

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.200
<i>I'll hit you with them now.</i>

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.200
<i>I'll hit you with it now.</i>

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.780
<i>There's no need to hold back.</i>

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.270
<i>Now it's time to test my love.</i>

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.270
<i>Now it's time to test my all.</i>

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:04.030
<i>It keeps getting stronger, and won't stop...</i>

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:04.030
<i>I'm sure... I'm sure that I know...</i>

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:07.400
<i>I want to say, "I love you,"</i>

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.640
<i>to a fate that shone.</i>

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.640
<i>to a shining fate.</i>

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.170
<i>Ah, they're melting...</i>

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.170
<i>The two are...</i>

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:16.060
<i>The Sun and the Moon!</i>

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:27.310
Kiri-chan, you really can't stop?

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.060
If you want to make me stop,

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.720
you'll have to force me to.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:35.780
LiNKER?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.000
If things aren't going the way you want,

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.620
you have to force them to do so.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:53.890
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:08:53.890 --> 00:09:01.720
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.030
The Igalima's Climax Song is a blade

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.940
that cuts through its victim's soul!

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:11.730
If I can just take

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.160
a little of your stubbornness away...

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.120
Which of us is being stubborn?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.370
The world I want has to have you in it.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:30.760
I don't want a world which forces me to be lonely.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.710
I'm going to protect Shirabe,

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:43.970
even if Finé's soul erases mine!

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.610
The people the doctor saves 
will lose those they love,

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:55.340
just like me!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.440
Even if I survive in a world like that,

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.240
I'll never be able to sing again!

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.670
But it's the only way!

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.290
This is the only way!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.480
Even if it means

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.880
you hate me!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.050
Kiri-chan, don't fight anymore...

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:19.550
Don't take the Kiri-chan I love from me!

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.650
What is this?

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.400
No way... It's you, Shirabe?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:38.550
Shirabe's the one who's the vessel for Finé's soul,

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.410
but I...

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:41.840
Kiri-chan?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:45.660
I didn't want you to be sad...

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.590
But all I did was make you cry!

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.920
I'm really an awful girl, aren't I?

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.720
I want to disappear.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.640
No, Kiri-chan!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.890
Shirabe?

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:11.270
Shirabe!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:31.780
<i>...then make a vow to your pride!</i>

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.650
The Moon ruins remain silent.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:57.970
Can my songs

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.780
not save a single life, Serena?

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.780
She's just like Bikky and the others, right?

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.010
Yeah, she's singing...

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:11.790
...to save others.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:18.750
In the world I'm going to create,

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.760
Symphogear-wielders are unnecessary.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.500
That's why I brought them together to fight...

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.350
But I didn't expect it to go this well.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.210
Too easy!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.020
As promised,

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.390
I took care of Section 2's wielder.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.370
So give me the Staff of Solomon.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.670
Do I really need to make

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:54.390
a trade like that with a little girl?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:58.920
Why isn't it exploding?

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.210
It's broken.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:04.760
You'd expect a bad guy to break his promise.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.770
Noise? Right now?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:25.130
Anti-LiNKER comes when you least expect it.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.610
Then fly...

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.450
<i>Armor Purge!</i>

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.150
The Staff!

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.020
Senpai!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:07.400
<i>Ya-haiya a moment's sound...</i>

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:07.400
That Gear...

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:14.380
<i>Ya-haiya and all things pass away...</i>

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:08.680
Impossible.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.530
She deliberately chose a Gear

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.890
with a lesser phonic gain,

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.410
to ease the stress from the anti-LiNKER?

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:23.840
<i>Ya-haiya-haiya-hai-ya. Ame no Habakiri...</i>

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.410
Could she do that?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.290
She could... That's who she is.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.090
<i>A blade like a hurricane.</i>

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.140
<i>A thousand beautiful flowers.</i>

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.560
<i>A crescent Moon, shining in the night.</i>

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:37.730
<i>Sadness, return to the pure land forever.</i>

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.860
I'll end this with the next attack.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.520
All this time, I've worked on 
this combination attack.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.590
<i>A warrior, lamenting,</i>

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.530
Then I'll show you the killing side of my blade.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:49.570
<i>wipes away a tear.</i>

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.340
<i>Memories and pride</i>

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:55.110
Because it was the combination attack 
we worked so hard on together,

00:14:53.430 --> 00:15:00.220
<i>become a single flash of lightning!</i>

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.450
I'd have known the attacks with my eyes closed.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:58.960
So I could dodge them.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.520
And I knew she'd dodge.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.880
<i>Begone!</i>

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.660
Because we understood each 
other with a single word,

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.810
<i>A flame, burning without thought.</i>

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.920
I could let her play along with my stupidity.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:06.920
<i>Inside a Kagura wind,</i>

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.580
<i>destroy, and die a glorious death.</i>

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:12.150
<i>An ancient song that splits the night,</i>

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.810
<i>filled with love and beauty.</i>

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.810
<i>I go now,</i>

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.810
I'm not hanging around for this!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.490
<i>resolve in my heart,</i>

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.590
<i>asking myself what true courage is.</i>

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:24.220
<i>Ah, a flashing sword risks it all</i>

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:30.200
<i>on the bonds between us.</i>

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.420
<i>The time for talk is over. Now...</i>

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:40.350
<i>End it all with a splash!</i>

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.850
Recovery complete.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.860
Now we can relax.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.970
Sorry I ran off on my own...

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.390
Don't worry about it.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.990
I was reminded that I can't do 
anything on my own, either.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:01.850
And more than anything,

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.610
I was lucky, seeing Yukine being a good girl.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.140
Even so,

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.610
why did you believe what I said?

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.730
Because you called me your senpai.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:18.740
I couldn't ignore what you were about to say.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.120
Was that all?

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.150
That was all.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.670
Okay, let's go meet up with Tachibana.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:27.920
<i>She really is crazy.</i>

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.910
<i>That's why, whether I like it or not,</i>

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.460
<i>my home is by these guys' sides.</i>

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.140
Damn it!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.890
I can't believe I lost the Staff of Solomon!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.150
I'll have to send Maria after them!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.150
Shirabe, wake up!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.650
Shirabe!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.550
Shirabe!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:54.660
Shirabe!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:57.990
Kiri-chan...

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.520
No?

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.150
Which means you are...

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:04.750
Does it matter?

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.620
It matters a lot.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.920
My friend is crying.

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:10.770
That's true.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.020
I had intended to stay quiet,

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:16.860
without erasing anyone's soul.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.920
But I suppose I have no choice.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.300
After being hit with a strike that 
tears the soul in two,

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.690
I will not last that long...

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.680
You protected me?

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.650
But why?

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.030
I want you to tell her.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.540
"Her"?

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:37.080
For millennia, I have been the villain.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.780
Sometime, somewhere...

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:44.080
It's too late to pretend to be a hero.

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:47.920
You, living in the present, must deal with it.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:51.840
Tachibana Hibiki...

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:56.380
Sometime in the future, people will be connected.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.260
Sharing that isn't the role for a ghost.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.340
Open your eyes, Shirabe...

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.660
They're open, Kiri-chan.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.940
Your wounds...

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.700
Stare.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.150
Shirabe!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.320
But how?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.010
I think Finé's soul protected me.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:26.030
Finé saved you?

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.020
Everyone's helping me...

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:32.930
So I want you to help me, too.

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.420
Let's save Maria together.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.690
Yeah.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.850
This time, you and I

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.110
will save everyone.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:48.060
Maria, try to reactivate the lunar ruins again.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.510
I can't! My songs can't save the world...

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:54.070
Maria, this is our last chance

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.370
to stop the Moon from falling.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.450
Dumbass!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:05.400
If the Moon fails to fall, I won't 
be able to do whatever I want!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:06.930
Maria?

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:08.960
I knew it. It's the old bat.

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:11.280
Listen to me, Dr. Ver.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:13.210
If we can use Frontier's capabilities

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.550
to fire the collected phonic gain at the Moon,

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.970
and reboot the ruins that control Balal's Curse,

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.340
we can return the Moon to its proper orbit!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:25.130
If you want to activate the ruins that badly,

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.380
then you go to the Moon!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.310
Mom!

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.970
The reason all the heroes throughout history

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:38.070
have been unable to rule humanity

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.320
is that humanity's numbers were too great!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:43.750
Thus, I need but reduce humanity 
to the point that I can rule them!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.080
Only a genius like me could have figured it out...

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:50.510
I've always wanted to be a hero, 
and now I'll be greater than one.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.150
How dare you do that to Mom?!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.090
Can you kill me?

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:02.090
Killing me means killing all of humanity!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:03.600
I'll kill you!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.510
Out of the way, fusion-syndrome patient #1!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:11.280
No!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.180
I'm Tachibana Hibiki, age 16!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.030
I'm not some "fusion-syndrome patient"!

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:19.860
I'm just Tachibana Hibiki, and I'm here 
because I wanted to talk to you!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.030
There's no need to talk to you!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.340
He killed Mom!

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.780
So I'm going to kill him, too!

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.690
If I can't protect the world,

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:30.620
there's no reason for me to live!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.170
You...

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.430
You can look for the reason later.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.680
So don't give up on living!

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:57.470
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.430
A holy incantation?

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:56.650
What are you thinking?!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.070
That's...

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.490
We need to save Maria!

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.810
That dummy's behind this?

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:13.480
Yeah, but that's just like Tachibana.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.940
What's going on?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:31.110
This is impossible!

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.640
The fusion patient shouldn't be able to do this.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:35.640
Is this your song?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:38.150
Did the song in your heart do this?

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.150
What is your song?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:41.650
What is it?!

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.420
Go, Hibiki!

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:44.650
With all your heart!

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:02.800
It's "Striking Spear Gungnir"!
